  "Juan Esteban Torres Delgado. Desarrollador Full Stack con experiencia en React, Node.js, PostgreSQL y plataformas educativas.": "Juan Esteban Torres Delgado. Full Stack Developer with experience in React, Node.js, PostgreSQL and educational platforms.",
